<item><title>Rwanda and Uganda launch three-year police plan against cross-border crime</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/rw/rwanda-and-uganda-launch-three-year-police-plan-against-1cfe36/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/rw/rwanda-and-uganda-launch-three-year-police-plan-against-1cfe36/</guid><category>Rwanda</category><description>The programme sets out joint investigations, intelligence-sharing and coordinated operations against trafficking, terrorism, smuggling and cybercrime.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:23:19 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/rw/rwanda-and-uganda-launch-three-year-police-plan-against-1cfe36/share.jpg" length="42124" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/rw/rwanda-and-uganda-launch-three-year-police-plan-against-1cfe36/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Rwanda&apos;s defence minister holds talks at Brussels security forum</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/rw/rwanda-s-defence-minister-holds-talks-at-brussels-security-729763/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/rw/rwanda-s-defence-minister-holds-talks-at-brussels-security-729763/</guid><category>Rwanda</category><description>Juvenal Marizamunda met government officials and international organisations at the European Union&apos;s security forum, which drew delegates from more than 80 partner countries.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:13:58 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/rw.jpg" length="31934" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/rw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
